#: org.kde.calligra.sheets.metainfo.xml:6
#. (itstool) path: component/name
msgid "Calligra Sheets"
msgstr "कैलिग्रा शीट्स"

#: org.kde.calligra.sheets.metainfo.xml:7
#. (itstool) path: component/summary
msgid "Spreadsheet"
msgstr "स्प्रेडशीट"

#: org.kde.calligra.sheets.metainfo.xml:9
#. (itstool) path: description/p
msgid ""
"Calligra Sheets is a fully-featured calculation and spreadsheet tool. Use "
"it to quickly create and calculate various business-related spreadsheets, "
"such as income and expenditure, employee working hours, etc."
msgstr ""
"Calligra Sheets इति पूर्णविशेषतायुक्तं गणना-स्प्रेड्शीट्-उपकरणम् अस्ति । "
"तस्य उपयोगं शीघ्रं विविधव्यापारसम्बद्धानि स्प्रेडशीट्-निर्माणार्थं "
"गणनायाश्च कुर्वन्तु, यथा आयव्ययः, कर्मचारीकार्यसमयः इत्यादयः ।"

#: org.kde.calligra.sheets.metainfo.xml:13
#. (itstool) path: description/p
msgid "Features:"
msgstr "गुणाः:"

#: org.kde.calligra.sheets.metainfo.xml:15
#. (itstool) path: ul/li
msgid "Use shapes to take notes or mind maps"
msgstr "टिप्पणीं कर्तुं वा मनःचित्रं ग्रहीतुं आकृतीनां उपयोगं कुर्वन्तु"

#: org.kde.calligra.sheets.metainfo.xml:16
#. (itstool) path: ul/li
msgid "Large range of pre-defined templates"
msgstr "पूर्वनिर्धारितसारूप्यानां विशालपरिधिः"

#: org.kde.calligra.sheets.metainfo.xml:17
#. (itstool) path: ul/li
msgid "Powerful and comprehensive formula list"
msgstr "शक्तिशाली एवं व्यापक सूत्र सूची"

#: org.kde.calligra.sheets.metainfo.xml:18
#. (itstool) path: ul/li
msgid "Work in a familiar environment"
msgstr "परिचिते वातावरणे कार्यं कुर्वन्तु"
